      @channel_title="뉴렉처",
      @description=
       "안녕하세요. 뉴렉처(https://www.newlecture.com)입니다.\n" +
       "\n" +
       "- 실습용 코드 ---------------------------\n" +
       "    public static void clear() {\n" +
       "        try {\n" +
       "            String operatingSystem = System.getProperty(\"os.name\");\n" +
       "            if (operatingSystem.contains(\"Windows\")) {\n" +
       "                ProcessBuilder pb = new ProcessBuilder(\"cmd\", \"/c\", \"cls\");\n" +
       "                Process startProcess = pb.inheritIO().start();\n" +
       "                startProcess.waitFor();\n" +
       "            } else {\n" +
       "                ProcessBuilder pb = new ProcessBuilder(\"clear\");\n" +
       "                Process startProcess = pb.inheritIO().start();\n" +
       "                startProcess.waitFor();\n" +
       "            }\n" +
       "        } catch (Exception e) {\n" +
       "            System.out.println(e);\n" +
       "        }\n" +
       "    }\n" +
       "\n" +
       "이 영상은 프로그래밍을 처음 공부하는 분들을 위해 준비한 자바 코딩 영상입니다.\n" +
